{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "c1401a58-bb72-5fec-aac9-2dafe50683c2", "source_ordinal": 1782, "reading_ordinal": 2275, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "张记包子", "published_at": "2024-02-12T04:08:40+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/386784209/answer/3393839141"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "家里如果有一个小生意，尤其是站住脚了，摸清楚门道了，干了十年二十年的这种小生意，一定要往专业化、精细化方向好好发展，不要妄自菲薄。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 65}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "不管是摊鸡蛋饼还是蒸肠粉，不管是做紫砂壶还是做皮包，你能干十几二十年，如果你的客户群稳定，你已经进入了一两代客户的人生记忆。", "char_start": 66, "char_end": 128}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你很可以自豪了。", "char_start": 129, "char_end": 137}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "不要自己把自己看得那么轻贱，觉得自己无足轻重，地位低下。", "char_start": 138, "char_end": 166}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "说这话的要害不在于“抚慰你的感情”，而是说你对自己的价值估计错误，会造成你很多的损失。", "char_start": 167, "char_end": 210}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "第一个损失，就是你不会坚持在自己的技艺上做投资，缺少精益求精、趋向完善的动力、缺少对外营销、向上发展的勇气。因为自己觉得自己做的事情很卑微、很低贱，所以没有动力追求它的精湛和卓越，又因为自己没追求精湛和卓越，对外甚至连块能识别的招牌都不敢打出来，只敢叫“黄焖鸡米饭”、“遵义羊肉粉”，连个“张记”、“银记”、“国珍”这样的最基本的字号都没有。", "char_start": 211, "char_end": 382}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "于是没有任何品牌，没有任何印记，导致自己的老客户多年以后发感想，也只能写“学校门口商业街上那家牛肉炒粉”这种无痕无名的东西。", "char_start": 383, "char_end": 445}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这是一种自我放弃、自我戕害，把你本来可以拿到手的很多发展机会、甚至是获得财务自由的机会活活的浪费了——自卑应该成为精进的最大动力，而不是自轻自贱、自我放弃的完美理由。", "char_start": 446, "char_end": 529}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "第二类损失，就是从你自己散发出去的这种低贱的自我体认会自然的浸染身边的近亲近友，导致ta们也产生屈辱感、轻贱感，人人以你为耻。", "char_start": 530, "char_end": 593}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "人家以你为荣的基本前提是你自己不自轻自贱，ta们能在别人面前驳斥那些轻蔑言论的前提是回家你自己不会自己流露出这些自轻自贱的态度。", "char_start": 594, "char_end": 658}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "如果你自己自称“底层”、“没什么本事”、“p民”、“屌丝”，自己觉得自己确实“没啥本事”、确实“抬不起头来”、确实是“挣扎都是徒劳的次等人”，遇到点要求就说“穷人没资格讲究”、“我们高尚不起来”、“能应付过去就不错了”……这类打ta们脸的话，你让你的子女、亲友以什么为基础抬头挺胸，昂然面对别人的歧视和偏见？如何不让ta们敏感多疑，自轻自恨？", "char_start": 659, "char_end": 830}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "别人轻蔑你的话，恰恰跟你平时私下里挂在嘴边的话完全契合，ta们在外面怒斥他人“你们说得不对”，捍卫你的荣誉，你却在家用各种言语行动在说“不，ta们说得很对”，打ta们脸的并不是那些外人，而首先是你自己啊。", "char_start": 831, "char_end": 933}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "在这份自卑源头在你自身的前提下，“子女以父母为耻”岂不逻辑必然？批评子女“不该自卑”的立场何在？", "char_start": 934, "char_end": 982}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "自卑不是自弃的理由——实话跟你讲，任多大的天才、英雄、圣贤，都一样会有无穷尽的自卑，这是人类的本能特性，人就是这么设计的。", "char_start": 983, "char_end": 1044}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "不要因为自己自卑就轻看自己的价值，尤其是不要觉得说那些“谦虚”的鬼话叫“正确的认识自身”、“接纳自我”。这样做的代价不光是长期收入微薄而且事业毫无希望，更会直接导致众叛亲离。", "char_start": 1045, "char_end": 1132}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "在你自己自我放弃的前提下，子女看不起你、以你为耻，在某种程度上是在自外于这种有毒的家庭文化。", "char_start": 1133, "char_end": 1179}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这是一记警钟，不是靠“教子女独立思考”可以解决的。", "char_start": 1180, "char_end": 1205}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "与此相对照的，你会发现很多有一技之长的小业主的子女并不会简单的因为家里的小生意“业态原始”而有同样的症状。", "char_start": 1206, "char_end": 1259}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "小张家里学校买包子的，每天门口排队，去晚了就买不着了。ta们家不是什么大富大贵之家，但同学们何止不会看不起ta，还要托他的面子求插队好吗？", "char_start": 1260, "char_end": 1329}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "按照小朋友们的价值观，是ta的同学们回去向炒股票、写ppt的爹妈表示自己对小张的羡慕——埋怨自己家怎么做不出这么好吃的包子。", "char_start": 1330, "char_end": 1392}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "注意到没有？这个前提是张家包子有口皆碑。", "char_start": 1393, "char_end": 1413}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "把手里的包子做好，鸡蛋饼摊好，做到有人排队，先从下定决心开始，下定决心先从相信这可以而且应该做到开始。", "char_start": 1414, "char_end": 1465}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "一旦你认定这应该而且可以做到，不管能不能发财、仅仅从对得起自己的职业的角度就应该而且可以做到，你的整个气质就会改变，你的家庭文化就会改变，以你为荣却被你自己的言行打脸的风险就会大为消减。", "char_start": 1466, "char_end": 1559}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "若不是以你为荣太冒险、乃至于亲身被你自己的言行打了太多次脸，哪个人会优先选择以父母为耻而不是为荣呢？", "char_start": 1560, "char_end": 1610}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "这甚至不需要你做到手艺有口皆碑这个程度，只需要你丢掉“自认为不值一提、没有前途”的“自我接收”，这福利就已经开始生效了。", "char_start": 1611, "char_end": 1671}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "我们把话说简单点——你自轻自贱——不管是不是打着“谦虚”“现实”“自我接纳”这类听上去酷炫科幻的旗号——第一你会更容易长期贫穷，第二你的子女会不自觉的以你为耻，而且这不需要谁来故意为难你，是基于自然规律自动生效的。", "char_start": 1672, "char_end": 1779}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "老天爷对这种做法是什么态度，很明显了吧？", "char_start": 1780, "char_end": 1800}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "先把这个改了再说，先把“苍蝇馆子”的帽子摘掉。", "char_start": 1801, "char_end": 1824}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 28}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0337"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：家里靠卖鸡蛋饼为生，孩子不能接受，觉得大家都看不起他，家长该怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028"], "summary": "围绕“张记包子”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“家里如果有一个小生意，尤其是站住脚了，摸清楚门道了，干了十年二十年的这种小生意，一定要往专业化、精细化方向好好发展，不要妄自菲薄。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "家里如果有一个小生意，尤其是站住脚了，摸清楚门道了，干了十年二十年的这种小生意，一定要往专业化、精细化方向好好发展，不要妄自菲薄。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 65, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "48b0bb4c-98ec-5c20-918d-df43c894dd1c", "source_ordinal": 1781, "reading_ordinal": 2276, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "不脆弱义务", "published_at": "2024-02-13T03:46:01+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/309474618/answer/2041908739230398003"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "思考一下这个问题——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "一个人要对自己的生命承担多大范围的责任？", "char_start": 11, "char_end": 31}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "假如张三死了，有多大的责任要由张三自己承担，又有多大的责任由其他人承担？", "char_start": 32, "char_end": 68}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这个尺度张三自己要如何把握？", "char_start": 69, "char_end": 83}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这个尺度线客观讲就是刑法。", "char_start": 84, "char_end": 97}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这里不考虑侦破难度、质证有效性这些技术性问题，就假设一切的真相都已经呈堂，大白于天下，根据刑法的规定，对方有责任的部分就该由对方负责，除此之外的部分，张三就该要明白，这该由自己负责，是你自己对你自己承担的责任。", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 203}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这里面有一个至关重要的基本事实，就是侮辱罪、诽谤罪，即使成立，也是不会判死刑的。", "char_start": 204, "char_end": 244}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "换言之——如果你因为别人的侮辱也罢、诽谤也罢，承受不住，自杀了，对方无论有多明显的、确凿的罪责，法律仍然认为对方不需要负全责。", "char_start": 245, "char_end": 308}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "法律认定你有不可推卸的、自己扛住侮辱和诽谤的自我责任。", "char_start": 309, "char_end": 336}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "如果你被人骂死了、埋汰死了，你自己必须承担部分责任——甚至，如果你仔细考虑侮辱罪、诽谤罪的惩罚上限，就知道客观上法律认为你自己这部分还是主责。", "char_start": 337, "char_end": 408}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "无论别人说话多难听、多有威胁性，也无论这人是谁，如果仅仅是限于语言，你如果自戕，主责都在你自己。", "char_start": 409, "char_end": 457}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你有坚持不脆弱的义务，这是生而为人必须有的觉悟。被人骂死、羞辱死，必然出自对方的侮辱和你自己放弃不脆弱义务的里应外合。", "char_start": 458, "char_end": 517}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "出于人言而自尽，必然包含着你自己对自己的背叛和出卖，你自己必然要承担主要责任。", "char_start": 518, "char_end": 557}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "记住了——要杀我，你们必须要上物理手段。电死我、掐死我、饿死我、打死我、闷死我……想我死，你们只管试。", "char_start": 558, "char_end": 609}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "但是，想要仅凭语言、仅凭说话——不管你们说得有理无理、是否人多势众、是否巧言令色、是否感天动地、是否义正辞严——就让我自己去死，你们想都别想。", "char_start": 610, "char_end": 681}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "那是不可能的事。", "char_start": 682, "char_end": 690}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你们想杀死我，必须要犯点被证实会把牢底坐穿的刑事罪。", "char_start": 691, "char_end": 717}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这是人对自己的最基本的生存责任，听懂没有？", "char_start": 718, "char_end": 739}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "什么“xx骂我，所以我去死”这种话，你自己想想，是不是欠打？", "char_start": 740, "char_end": 770}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "骂就能骂死你，说就能说死你，不用犯任何刑事罪就能弄死你，你不觉得你活得有点太轻、太薄了吗？", "char_start": 771, "char_end": 816}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "那些依靠你的、信任你的、投资你的人是活该吗？谁要ta们眼瞎，要去依靠、信任、投资一个能被人仅仅用语言就说死的人，是这样吗？", "char_start": 817, "char_end": 878}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "对方触犯了刑法导致了你的死亡，主责一定在对方那边。", "char_start": 879, "char_end": 904}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "对方没触犯刑法就导致了你的死亡，不管有多少人同情你，到最后社会成员们必然普遍认为你自己负主责。", "char_start": 905, "char_end": 952}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这就是人活在世上最基本的“不脆弱义务”。", "char_start": 953, "char_end": 973}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "在你开口斥责、反击、哭诉之前，这一条你务必要想起。", "char_start": 974, "char_end": 999}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "如果你现在死了，对方有多少确切的刑事责任？如果没有，你选择死亡的责任就主要在你。", "char_start": 1000, "char_end": 1040}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "如果是这样，你把自己害了之后，对方将得到的不是千夫所指，反而会是纷至沓来的安慰——“这也怪不了你，现在的xx太脆弱了，防不胜防”。", "char_start": 1041, "char_end": 1106}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "有足够多的人这样安慰ta，ta最后很有可能会坦然释怀——“的确没料到你这么脆弱，但人非圣贤，撞上这种难度的，只能认倒霉而已，产生不了什么教训，因为你不能无限的假设对方受不了”。", "char_start": 1107, "char_end": 1195}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 30}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0337"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：那些会把孩子逼死的父母会后悔吗？会反省吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028"], "summary": "围绕“不脆弱义务”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“思考一下这个问题——”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "思考一下这个问题——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b2e93445-8858-5500-be38-83f1ea10d4ac", "source_ordinal": 1780, "reading_ordinal": 2277, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "老法师", "published_at": "2024-02-13T13:55:55+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/637697519/answer/3394994943"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "社会最复杂的东西不是它明面上的法律法规、业务流程，而是这样的法律法规、业务流程会引起人们什么样的适应性行为。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 54}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "规则、流程不管多复杂，都是相对简单的，真正的复杂性、不可预测性是出自不断自我反馈、自我调整的人的智力活动、尤其是群体性的智力活动对简单的规则的极端复杂的交互适应。", "char_start": 55, "char_end": 136}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "很多人都知道三体问题极为复杂，人类之间的交互关系远远的复杂过万有引力定律，而人群数量又远远大过3，想要靠理论计算预测大量人群的具体行为在数学上干脆就是原则性的不可能的。", "char_start": 137, "char_end": 221}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这跟“老法师”有什么关系？", "char_start": 222, "char_end": 235}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "老法师自己亲眼看过实体运行的状态了，不是计算机模拟、而是直接看着真实的世界反复运行过了。", "char_start": 236, "char_end": 280}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "他们直接看见了复杂的人群在每一个环节对特定的业务流程和规则的反应，一遍又一遍，观察到了某些稳定反复的现象，然后从这些现象中抽象出了某些共性。", "char_start": 281, "char_end": 351}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "在这些共性上建立了ta们自己的方法，这些方法可以借助这些现象的反复不断获利，却又不会改变——甚至会稳定这些现象的发生概率。", "char_start": 352, "char_end": 413}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "是这个让ta们成了“老法师”。", "char_start": 414, "char_end": 429}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "亲见亲历，此谓老；", "char_start": 430, "char_end": 439}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "找到了嵌合到稳定路径上的有效策略，此谓法；", "char_start": 440, "char_end": 461}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "可求，可教，学生受教之后也可以继承这种有效性，此谓师。", "char_start": 462, "char_end": 489}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "此谓老法师。", "char_start": 490, "char_end": 496}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这样的人，在任何年代都会有，但却可遇而不可求。", "char_start": 497, "char_end": 520}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "为什么呢？", "char_start": 521, "char_end": 526}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "因为这些老法师掌握的东西实际上是一种“秘术”，是不能广为流传的。一旦广为人知，就会对脆弱的复杂系统造成过大的影响，导致流程和规则本身发生改变，从而导致ta们的经验失效。", "char_start": 527, "char_end": 611}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "不像那种教物理、数学的教师，物理数学会的人再多，也不会导致物理定律、数学定理改变，老法师的手段会的人、用的人太多，业务流程和规则就可能会变。而哪怕有很小的改变，都可能因为人本身的复杂性导致局势发生颠覆性的变化——所以老法师的诀窍都是秘传。", "char_start": 612, "char_end": 731}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "另一方面，老法师们非常清楚自己手里的技术、诀窍是有时代性的，过上几十年就可能自动失效，所以老法师们往往希望及时寻找到传人，最大限度的发挥自己心得的价值，并希望从这份价值里获取自己的一份额外收益。如果能继承自己的观察，继续跟住时代的发展推出更进一步的新方法则更好。", "char_start": 732, "char_end": 863}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "但即使有这么迫切的愿望，传人的资格要求也是高度严格的。", "char_start": 864, "char_end": 891}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这一般有三个要求——", "char_start": 892, "char_end": 902}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "1）悟性要足够。", "char_start": 903, "char_end": 911}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "有效期有限，如果你天资愚钝，不能举一反三、触类旁通，那么等把你教会，包子已经凉了。这对老法师自身也是一种巨大的浪费。", "char_start": 912, "char_end": 970}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "其实悟性本身并不是一个简单的智商问题，还是一个面对未知挑战的经验问题、意志问题。只有无惧于未知，常年与之缠斗、积累了大量的斗争经验和必胜信心的人，才会自然的显示出“悟性”。", "char_start": 971, "char_end": 1057}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "2）义理分明。", "char_start": 1058, "char_end": 1065}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "知道自己是遇到了多大的机缘，知道是谁欠了谁，知道该以什么样的配合度、什么样的礼数来对待自己的机会，而且懂得这是自己选的，是自己对自己的要求，而不是跑去迁怒于人。", "char_start": 1066, "char_end": 1146}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "所以这类故事往往有一些“无礼试探”，例如把鞋子踢到桥下要你捡这一类，往往只有福至心灵的明白人能足够心平气和的通过这些试炼。", "char_start": 1147, "char_end": 1208}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "义理分明还意味着懂得这份交换关系里自己的义务和责任，知道收益应该如何分享，保证自己的交易信用，而不是“教会徒弟、饿死师傅”。", "char_start": 1209, "char_end": 1271}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "3）为人沉稳、不轻浮。", "char_start": 1272, "char_end": 1283}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "最典型的一点，就是不会小人乍富，招摇过市，口没遮拦，“四海飘香”。这其实是一种吃饭砸锅、不知好歹的愚蠢行为，但绝不是谁都知道这有多愚蠢。", "char_start": 1284, "char_end": 1352}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "得到一点传授，拿去稍微一试，果然效验入神，大喜，这就觉得够了，够自己咸鱼翻身了，就算后面还有更高深的也不需要了，要急于“享受生活”了、要“补偿自己低声下气多年的委屈”了，要“破除师傅的陈腐观念”了。", "char_start": 1353, "char_end": 1452}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "这也是老法师们最容易遭遇挫败的地方，因为这要在很长一段时间后才看得出来。", "char_start": 1453, "char_end": 1489}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "你如果有这三条，这个世界上瞪大眼睛在找传人的老法师比比皆是，迟早有一个——甚至不止一个——会找上你。", "char_start": 1490, "char_end": 1540}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "这是世界上最常年、最主流的“天降贵人”模式，绝不是什么“万中无一”的机缘，而是“上亿老法师在找几亿传人”这样的规模。", "char_start": 1541, "char_end": 1599}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "你没遇到，问问自己为什么。", "char_start": 1600, "char_end": 1613}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 39}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0337"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：电视剧《繁花》中爷叔是一个很厉害的人，被宝总称为老法师，当时那个年代真的会有这样的人吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033"], "summary": "围绕“老法师”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“社会最复杂的东西不是它明面上的法律法规、业务流程，而是这样的法律法规、业务流程会引起人们什么样的适应性行为。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "社会最复杂的东西不是它明面上的法律法规、业务流程，而是这样的法律法规、业务流程会引起人们什么样的适应性行为。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 54, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "108ce1d9-cec6-5692-8e67-def6a1e7e820", "source_ordinal": 1779, "reading_ordinal": 2278, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "大钱大官", "published_at": "2024-02-13T19:09:45+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/24561532/answer/3395220875"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "一辈子没赚大钱、当大官，没和自己爱的人在一起（哪怕一次），活着都能算有意义。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 38}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "否则你把雷锋、董存瑞，把那无数的无名先烈放哪里？", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 63}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "把那些在地下战线舍生忘死，前赴后继的无名英雄放哪里？", "char_start": 64, "char_end": 90}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "ta们活着没意义？没你“聪明”是吗？", "char_start": 91, "char_end": 109}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "只有声色犬马、作威作福算“人生意义”？", "char_start": 110, "char_end": 129}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "家里教的是些什么东西？！", "char_start": 130, "char_end": 142}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "相信这些东西，想不抑郁得有多难？", "char_start": 143, "char_end": 159}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 7}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0337"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：若一辈子没有赚大钱，当大官，和自己爱的人在一起（哪怕一次），活着能算有意义吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007"], "summary": "围绕“大钱大官”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“一辈子没赚大钱、当大官，没和自己爱的人在一起（哪怕一次），活着都能算有意义。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "一辈子没赚大钱、当大官，没和自己爱的人在一起（哪怕一次），活着都能算有意义。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 38, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "24ff3331-d42d-595c-b479-23063e8659b8", "source_ordinal": 1778, "reading_ordinal": 2279, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "我不问，你不说", "published_at": "2024-02-13T22:04:11+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/347389462/answer/3395361991"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这事其实不推荐做。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "发现对方的问题，权衡信任的后果，应该是当事人自己的责任，是当事人自己的自由。", "char_start": 10, "char_end": 48}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "或迟或早，当事人都会走到一个节点，说“我知道的已经足够了，这之外的我不计较了，愿赌服输”。", "char_start": 49, "char_end": 94}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你以前不管干过任何事都罢，对我都没啥不同，不会改变我的决定。我决心已下，于是就可以停止无休止的担忧和好奇了。", "char_start": 95, "char_end": 149}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "从这个下定决心的点开始，知道越多，对我只会是额外的负担。", "char_start": 150, "char_end": 178}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "我下定了决心，哪怕你杀过人、坐过牢，我也绝不动摇，但是我如果不知道你曾经杀过人、坐过牢，比知道肯定负担小。", "char_start": 179, "char_end": 232}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "再说一遍——这是每一个真正下定决心去爱的人必须经过的逻辑阶段，必然的心路历程。", "char_start": 233, "char_end": 272}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "否则无穷尽的恐惧和怀疑会无限的推迟你下定决心的时间，以至于它最终必然是一句空话。", "char_start": 273, "char_end": 313}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "也使“爱”变成了一种毫无意义的胆小鬼游戏。", "char_start": 314, "char_end": 335}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "所以，对方如果是出于爱缔结关系，我就算知道什么，我也会闭嘴。", "char_start": 337, "char_end": 367}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "因为我相信这位下定了决心的爱人说的是真的，是真的无论富贵贫穷、健康疾病、顺境逆境，不离不弃。", "char_start": 368, "char_end": 414}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "在这种决定之下，提醒对方“风险”“欺骗”其实是多余的，而且甚至是不友善的。", "char_start": 415, "char_end": 452}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "因为这是在给对方立誓不会改变的决定额外平添负担。", "char_start": 453, "char_end": 477}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "自己得到“古道热肠”的道德感，别人得到沉重的精神负担，这是损人利己罢了。", "char_start": 478, "char_end": 514}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这也提示你们自己——不要轻言嬉笑，玩弄爱的游戏。", "char_start": 515, "char_end": 539}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "因为你这个“爱”字一出口，我们周围的这些旁观者如果依道而行，可能会改用一些你意想不到的规则来对待你。", "char_start": 540, "char_end": 590}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "一个对你——一个实质上不理解爱的法则的人——近乎残酷无情的规则。", "char_start": 591, "char_end": 623}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "然而，恰恰是我们会以这样的规则对待你，你才自然而然赢得我们油然而生的敬意。", "char_start": 624, "char_end": 661}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "任何一个人可以自愿的、真诚的承受这样的规则，只要是生有灵性的存在，都不可能不动容，不可能不尊重。", "char_start": 662, "char_end": 710}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "因为抛开一切其他的技术、能力、权势地位不谈，仅凭你在明知这样的承诺意味着什么的前提下还能自愿的、无怨无悔的领受这种“苛待”，这都是不折不扣的英勇行为。", "char_start": 711, "char_end": 786}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "仅凭这一点，在你面前，就没有任何人可以再自称更高贵。", "char_start": 787, "char_end": 813}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "真正奉行爱的原则的人，一旦下定了决心，就不但不会埋怨别人不告诉ta“真相”，还会感激。", "char_start": 814, "char_end": 857}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "ta会感激你没有问ta，就能相信ta的觉悟是完整而且真实的。", "char_start": 858, "char_end": 888}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "无论后果是什么，ta都不会迁怒于你。", "char_start": 889, "char_end": 907}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "因为这就是ta自己下定的决心的题中应有之义。", "char_start": 908, "char_end": 930}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 26}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0337"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我把朋友的病史告诉她男朋友了，她婚事黄了，我是不是做错了？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025"], "summary": "围绕“我不问，你不说”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这事其实不推荐做。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这事其实不推荐做。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b3d9b767-65e4-5572-b3f6-ddb2d24097a1", "source_ordinal": 1777, "reading_ordinal": 2280, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "王家的秘密", "published_at": "2024-02-14T13:34:48+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/637599975/answer/3395867118"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "《繁花》最重要的价值核心是什么？是什么在指导所有主角的所有抉择？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 32}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "是什么决定爷叔选择阿宝？", "char_start": 33, "char_end": 45}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "是什么决定阿宝原谅发根的儿子？", "char_start": 46, "char_end": 61}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "是什么决定李李在黄河路鹤立鸡群？", "char_start": 62, "char_end": 78}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "是什么决定汪小姐令魏宏庆刮目相看，又令魏宏庆被范总不当人子？", "char_start": 79, "char_end": 109}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "是什么决定玲子爱宝总，而玲子又令强慕杰念念不忘？", "char_start": 110, "char_end": 134}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "是什么决定菱红总是跟着玲子，而后又下定决心要离玲子而去？", "char_start": 135, "char_end": 163}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "是什么决定金科送邮票给汪小姐，而爷叔又把邮票交还金科？", "char_start": 164, "char_end": 191}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "是什么让范总最后死心塌地认准了阿宝和汪小姐？", "char_start": 192, "char_end": 214}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "是什么让舰队胖阿姨、邮票李和蔡司令紧跟阿宝？", "char_start": 215, "char_end": 237}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "是什么让看尽人间百态的景秀总对阿宝和李李另眼相看？", "char_start": 238, "char_end": 263}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "是腔调。", "char_start": 264, "char_end": 268}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这不是面子，而是一整套的义理原则，一种“无论怎样，要对得起自己人”的坚决。", "char_start": 269, "char_end": 306}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "滴水之恩，必当涌泉相报；一诺千金，不辱使命，不负所托，不枉相识；体体面面，绝不偷奸耍滑，绝不拉稀摆带。同时吃软不吃硬，富贵不能淫、贫贱不能移、威武不能屈，对外绝不屈服于威胁和压力……", "char_start": 307, "char_end": 398}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这里面真要往下说是非常复杂的一大套行为规范，但归根到底，其实每个中国人都明白，到底什么叫“有腔调”、什么叫“没腔调”。", "char_start": 399, "char_end": 458}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "其实这在全世界都有，这在中国就叫腔调，叫体面；在英国就叫dignity，叫honor；在日本就叫义理，叫武士道……", "char_start": 459, "char_end": 516}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "其实这就是贵族精神的内核——一种“我绝不回避而且一定超额完成社会责任”的原则。至于表面上那些“排场”、那些整洁的服饰、精美的妆容、优雅的谈吐举止……实际上都是“面对应尽的责任不但完全承担，而且游刃有余，资源和能力自然溢出”的自然结果。", "char_start": 517, "char_end": 634}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "是一种“超额信用”的自然流露。", "char_start": 635, "char_end": 650}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "一个有腔调的人如果是你的朋友，那么你无论如何都不会因为和ta的交往而吃亏——如果是ta有错，你一定得到补偿；如果ta根本都没错，这事只要和ta有关，你吃亏了，ta都一定会额外给你补偿。这是一种难度极高的活法，任何意志不坚定、原则不坚固的人实际上都是无法办到的。所以敢于奉行它，本身就需要超出常人的决心和能力。", "char_start": 651, "char_end": 805}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "所以普通人对能做到这个程度的人既敬又妒。", "char_start": 806, "char_end": 826}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "敬的是没想到真的有人能做到，妒的是没想到真的有人敢相信自己能做到。", "char_start": 827, "char_end": 860}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "做不做得到先放一边，我觉得我自己绝对做不到的事，你敢相信你能做到，本身就是对我无声的冒犯，我不可能不在另一面妒恨你。", "char_start": 861, "char_end": 919}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "在中国——实际上是在全世界——有腔调都是一个极其重要的门槛，它是真正的独立执业的资格。", "char_start": 921, "char_end": 964}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "也就是汪小姐说的“码头”。", "char_start": 965, "char_end": 978}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "你有腔调，你才能立得住码头，你才有你的字号。别人——无论ta多么财雄势大——才能、也才会将你看作人格对等的存在。", "char_start": 979, "char_end": 1035}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "这不是你有多大的注册资本、秀出来多大的排场可以替代的，这只能在一饮一啄的点滴言行中，在你缔约履约的行为选择中去验证和树立。", "char_start": 1036, "char_end": 1097}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "并且，你得自己独立做到。如果你是在别人的帮助下做到，在我们眼里，认的就是你的帮手，你就只是个办事员，不是一个码头。", "char_start": 1098, "char_end": 1155}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "这就是“汪小姐不能和宝总在一起”“玲子不能和宝总在一起”的根源——", "char_start": 1156, "char_end": 1189}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "一个码头只能有一个人，要码头，就不能要人。", "char_start": 1190, "char_end": 1211}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "而从阿宝的视角来看，他面临的矛盾更微妙——事实上他内心深处更敬佩能立得住码头的人，而不是“贤内助”。这就导致除了年轻时出于本能结缘的雪芝之外，他爱慕的都是能立码头的人。", "char_start": 1212, "char_end": 1296}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "不独立自强到能立码头，不能独当一面，在阿宝的眼里就不能算是同等级的同类。", "char_start": 1297, "char_end": 1333}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "然而，如果把这样的人仅仅用作“贤内助”“好帮手”，出于自己的欲望而亲手毁灭对方创立码头、屹立在群雄之间的机会，那又会令他有背叛爱的原则的负罪感。", "char_start": 1334, "char_end": 1406}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "唯一能帮他解脱这种困境的，就是对方矢志不渝的、毫不含糊的用行动表明“我自己宁愿不要码头，也要跟你”。", "char_start": 1407, "char_end": 1457}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "只要对方流露一点点的犹豫，一点点的“你帮我选”，对阿宝而言，就有绝对的义务帮对方选码头。", "char_start": 1458, "char_end": 1502}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "因为在他自己内心深处，深深的觉得这种站在旷野之中，一切只在自己与上天之间的自由是人类最大的享受、最大的幸福。", "char_start": 1503, "char_end": 1557}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "他有义务为自己所爱的人选择这样的幸福——这甚至不仅仅指女性、指亲密关系，而是所有人、包括朋友、甚至包括开电梯的小朋友。", "char_start": 1558, "char_end": 1617}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "而偏偏，汪小姐要他选。", "char_start": 1618, "char_end": 1629}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "你要跟，就不要给他选择。你给他选，就是其实自己选了，但把自己没有勇气承担的痛苦交给他去代为承担罢了。", "char_start": 1630, "char_end": 1680}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "他替你承担了这个痛苦，这就是对你的爱了。", "char_start": 1681, "char_end": 1701}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "你想要的，你已经得到了。", "char_start": 1702, "char_end": 1714}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "追根到底，《繁花》实际上是在呈现一种“商业道德”，一种社会化的规范。", "char_start": 1716, "char_end": 1750}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "这也是它最内里的魅力所在。", "char_start": 1751, "char_end": 1764}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "王家卫拍《一代宗师》，讲的是一个“礼”字。", "char_start": 1765, "char_end": 1786}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "拍《繁花》，其实讲的也是一个“礼”字。只不过一个是在民国乱世、在家族、宗派的场景下，一个是在改开时代，在商业勃兴的场景下。", "char_start": 1787, "char_end": 1848}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "中国是礼仪之邦，世奉礼教，诗礼传家，这个字是融入每一个以汉语为母语的人的血脉、骨髓里的。", "char_start": 1849, "char_end": 1893}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "只要唤起对这个字的共鸣，就能唤起中国人的情感，令看得懂的人微醺。", "char_start": 1894, "char_end": 1926}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "这个字也恰恰是中国发展到现在，所有人都感到饥渴不足的关键要素。", "char_start": 1927, "char_end": 1958}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "这其实就是王家卫的秘密。", "char_start": 1959, "char_end": 1971}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 50}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0337"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：电视剧《繁花》中宝总为什么没有和汪小姐在一起？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048"], "summary": "围绕“王家的秘密”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“《繁花》最重要的价值核心是什么？是什么在指导所有主角的所有抉择？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "《繁花》最重要的价值核心是什么？是什么在指导所有主角的所有抉择？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 32, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d815aca8-698b-5bbf-a429-39e49a2df775", "source_ordinal": 1776, "reading_ordinal": 2281, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "来不来", "published_at": "2024-02-15T11:36:28+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/638480589/answer/3396711873"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "所有的外贸都要经过外贸局拿到出口指标、进口指标，否则无法结算外汇和通关，这是总前提。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 42}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "汪小姐从外贸局离职，是被举报、被调查后发生的。举报她的人既没有离职，也没有受到任何处分，反而成了第一顺位的科长人选。", "char_start": 43, "char_end": 101}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "只这一条，只要金科长不公开态度——例如亲自出席或者公开赠送礼物，汪小姐的场就没人敢捧，除非自己活得不耐烦了。", "char_start": 102, "char_end": 156}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "甚至就算阿宝去捧场也没用，因为阿宝只是个商人，手里没有任何权力。按照当时的规则，阿宝的行业影响力远在外贸局金科长之下。阿宝引以为豪的“大单子”，在金科长的案头只不过是日常工作中的千百常规案件之一而已。", "char_start": 157, "char_end": 257}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "甚至就算金科长支持，如果金科长即将调走而梅萍接任，那么这天去过的老板就全都是个死，敢投资的更是个死。", "char_start": 258, "char_end": 308}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "梅科长随便卡你几个月手续，找个理由把你的指标给别人，你的日常运营成本就可以把你生吞了。", "char_start": 309, "char_end": 352}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "第二，在外贸指标总量限定的前提下，每一个新公司都是全体老公司的竞争对手。换言之，汪小姐的公司也是宝总的竞争对手。", "char_start": 353, "char_end": 409}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "人到楼下大厅一坐，往包厢门缝里一探头，就知道宝总没来。没来，就意味着这家公司不是宝总的分公司，意味着投资这家公司就是要跟宝总竞争抢生意。", "char_start": 410, "char_end": 478}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "最有热情投资外贸公司、也最受外贸公司欢迎的是什么投资商？也就是汪小姐在招什么商？", "char_start": 479, "char_end": 519}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "那时候是没有红杉资本、高瓴资本的，汪小姐找的是生产企业——准确的说，是纺织品行业、服装行业的生产企业。", "char_start": 520, "char_end": 571}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "她是要找一家生产技术过硬、有产能的企业来帮她消化订单，完成生产。", "char_start": 572, "char_end": 604}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "问题是，这种企业脑子有水才会去选择以与宝总为敌为代价去与已经与外贸局有嫌隙的汪小姐为友。", "char_start": 605, "char_end": 649}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "宝总是外贸局的VIP、金牌业绩王，一个人的业务就足以保送一名科长，就算办事员对宝总有意见，都要憋在肚子里赔笑脸，求宝总给业绩，宝总的单子是有预期、有保障的。汪小姐有什么？", "char_start": 650, "char_end": 735}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "汪小姐为什么后面在江浙沪都找不到厂，只能跑到深圳去找？根本原因也是一样。谁要得罪财神去讨好被打落凡尘的猪八戒？", "char_start": 736, "char_end": 791}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "所以这根本就没什么奇怪的。", "char_start": 792, "char_end": 805}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0337"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：《繁花》中汪小姐的招商会为什么没人去？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015"], "summary": "围绕“来不来”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“所有的外贸都要经过外贸局拿到出口指标、进口指标，否则无法结算外汇和通关，这是总前提。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "所有的外贸都要经过外贸局拿到出口指标、进口指标，否则无法结算外汇和通关，这是总前提。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 42, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "f50711fa-fbcf-5b18-b2d3-6d0875faa87a", "source_ordinal": 1775, "reading_ordinal": 2282, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "多语种剧情", "published_at": "2024-02-15T13:23:32+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/639172024/answer/3396805420"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这不是“用上海方言”，而是“让剧中人用与场合、剧情相对应的语言”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 33}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "比如剧中人对李李说的就都是普通话。", "char_start": 34, "char_end": 51}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这跟拍东京大审判让日本人说日语、英国人说英语、广东人说粤语没什么区别。这是为了真实感、沉浸感，而不是为了“上海市场”。", "char_start": 52, "char_end": 111}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "同一个人，跟张三说本地话，转头对外人说普通话，这是有剧情含义的。就像狱中的大人跟小裸卜头说俄语交流以避开狱卒的监视，你要拍电影不能给它改成用普通话来演一样。", "char_start": 112, "char_end": 190}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "如果是纯沪语、纯英语、纯日语，反倒可以轻松的改成纯普通话。恰恰是综合运用而且嵌入剧情的不宜改。", "char_start": 191, "char_end": 238}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这个绝对应该看“沪语版”——这实际上是原版。", "char_start": 239, "char_end": 261}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这里谈的其实是“原版和普通话版”的区别，而不是“沪语版和普通话版“。", "char_start": 262, "char_end": 296}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "根本就没有所谓的“沪语版”。", "char_start": 297, "char_end": 311}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 8}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0337"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么《繁花》是上海方言？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008"], "summary": "围绕“多语种剧情”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这不是“用上海方言”，而是“让剧中人用与场合、剧情相对应的语言”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这不是“用上海方言”，而是“让剧中人用与场合、剧情相对应的语言”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 33, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
